  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "vt.",
      "zh": "允许，准许；承认"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Please "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "allow"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " me to tell an interesting story before the lesson."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "请允许我在上课前先讲一个有趣的故事。"
    }
  ],
  "phrases": [
    {
      "en": "allow doing",
      "zh": "允许做某事"
    },
    {
      "en": "allow sb. to do",
      "zh": "允许某人做某事"
    },
    {
      "en": "allow 10% for inflation",
      "zh": "允许 10% 通货膨胀"
    }
  ],
  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "permit, allow, let",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "这三个词都含有“允许”的意思。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "permit"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 较正式并含积极意义，它表示准许的一方有正式的权限及持有赞同的态度。它可接名词作宾语，不能接双宾语，可以用于 "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "permit sb. to do sth."
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 结构。当它作不及物动词时，要与 "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "of"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 连用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The situation does not "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "permit"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " of any delay. 情势不容许任何的拖延。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "allow"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 指听任或默认某人做某事，含有不加阻止、不反对的意思，也可用于正式场合表示客气的请求。可接名词作宾语，或接双宾语 "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "allow sb. sth."
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "，也可用于 "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "allow sb. to do sth."
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 结构。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The nurse "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "allowed"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " the visitors to remain beyond the hospital hours, though it was not permitted. 护士让探望者待到超过该院规定的探望时间，尽管这是不允许的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "let"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 作“允许”解，常用于口语。它常用于 "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "let sb. do"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 结构，作宾语补足语的不定式不带 "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "to"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Open the window and "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "let"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " in some fresh air. 打开窗户，让新鲜空气进来。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
